  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Explore Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Silba wants to do partner identification in Georgia because we hope to establish successful cooperation with a Georgian NGO. Our aim is to seek a main long-term partner that shares our vision and worldview, is trustworthy and loyal, and is dedicated to an international partnership with an equal division of responsibility. Through this network, we are able to exchange ideas, experiences and gain as much knowledge as possible from local entities to ensure a sustainable project targeted to their specific local context. The vision of our project is to contribute to a positive development amongst the Georgian IDP youths.</narrative>
  </description>
